# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# Without this, Windows checkouts get CRLF, and the working tree differs from
# the committed blob. That matters more than usual here: the content bundle is
# compared byte-for-byte by check-content-freshness, so line-ending drift would
# produce a check that passes on one machine and fails on another.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated content is compared exactly. Never let a filter touch it.
src/content/generated.ts -text

# Binary-ish assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
